# Sweety Hotel Website

## Project Overview
Sweety Hotel is a responsive website developed to provide information about hotel facilities, room types, pricing, gallery, and contact details. The website is designed with a simple and user-friendly interface to help visitors easily access important information.

## Features
- Home page with hostel introduction
- About Us section
- Room details and pricing
- Image gallery
- Contact page
- Responsive design for mobile and desktop
- SEO optimized with meta tags and page titles

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Netlify (Hosting)

## SEO
The website was analyzed using an SEO audit tool. It achieved:
- On-Page SEO: A+
- Usability: A+
- Performance: A+
- Links: Needs Improvement

## Website Link
https://sweetyhostel.netlify.app/

